Welcome to Elysium Outpost 1, Lieutenant. So far, we have evaded detection by the Chinese, but we are in a most dangerous position, nevertheless. We are barely 10 miles from the ruins of the Chthonian city. and the Chinese have had some months to build a base in those ruins - their HQ is huge; our current estimates suggest that there are in excess of 1,500 servicemen posted there. There is also a Chinese outpost less than a mile from us, whose Scavengers are getting worryingly close to our buildings. Your arrival here is a great morale boost for our men - until now, we've had to manage with the bare minimum of protection.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Patrol the area around Elysium Outpost 1.
- Respond to threats as necessary.

INTELLIGENCE REPORT:
It is essential that you limit your patrols to the immediate area surrounding Outpost 1, even if we are discovered by the Chinese. The cost to us in manpower would be greater than we could sustain if the Chinese were to mobilize the huge number of troops they already have on Elysium - covert reconnaissance suggests that at least one whole regiment are currently on Elysium, if not more.